### Local database ###
# The running app keeps its H2 file here. It holds real accounts, including
# password hashes, and it is rewritten on every run - so committing it both
# leaks credentials and guarantees a conflict on every pull.
data/*.mv.db
data/*.trace.db
data/*.lock.db

### JVM crash logs ###
# Written to the working directory when the JVM dies in native code, which for
# this project means OpenCV. Worth reading, not worth committing.
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log
